comment.body:
@Cluseau Research everyone ignores the 30% Q1 rev guide - unbelievable rev acceleration for a $200B topline biz. Everyone is asking to see ROI on capex but only looking at the bottom line vs the top line gains. 

$META did ~$31 EPS last year (but everyone says $24 b/c of the tax charge). They guided to flat for '26 but I think they eek out 10% YoY to keep the street happy. So you're looking at $35-40 EPS for 26/27 and trading like 15-17x that amount. 

Crazy how on sale it is right now

